\section{Hyperbolic Manifold Embedding}

Taxonomic lineage and divergence are embedded into the Poincaré ball 
$\mathbb{B}^d$ using Riemannian gradient descent.

Hyperbolic distance:

\[
d(u,v) = \operatorname{arcosh}\left(1 + 2\frac{\|u-v\|^2}
{(1-\|u\|^2)(1-\|v\|^2)}\right)
\]

Empirical metrics:

\begin{itemize}
    \item Embedding dimension: $d = 128$
    \item Mean Average Precision: $\mathrm{mAP} = 0.9841$
    \item Boundary stability at $\|u\| = 0.99999994$
\end{itemize}

